# Base URL of the CivicAI backend.
#
# Leave empty in local development: the Vite dev server is same-origin, so the
# browser talks to the page's own origin and no CORS configuration is needed on
# the backend.
#
# In production, set this to the origin the built app is served from, e.g.:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.civicai.example
#
# No secrets belong in this file. Only a URL.